## Pre-flight (before you touch prod)
- [ ] **Reconcile the live snapshot first** — diff what's *actually* deployed against `main` before
  building the release; the server can be ahead/behind your assumptions, and silent drift bites.
- [ ] Version bumped · lockstep manifests agree (if the project has more than one) · CHANGELOG written.
- [ ] Tests / build green from a clean checkout — gate on the **exit code**, not filtered output.

